From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rumisle <why-excuse-quail@duck.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 02:14:19 +0800
Subject: tui: report whether the TUI is in use to Web Push

Like the web app, the TUI tells the server (POST /api/ocelot/push/presence)
whether it is in use: the terminal is not known to be unfocused (focus
reporting) and a key or paste came in the last 3 minutes. While it is,
nothing is pushed to a phone. Quitting clears it at once; a non-ocelot
server answers 404 and the TUI stops reporting.

Ocelot-Patch: tui/push-presence

